Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)

Package: firmware-ap6275s
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Binary firmware for the AP6275S WiFi/Bluetooth module
 The AP6275S is a BCM43752A2 SDIO WiFi and Bluetooth module, used on the
 Mixtile Edge 2. linux-firmware carries no firmware for it.
 .
 This package contains the WiFi firmware, NVRAM and CLM blob for brcmfmac
 and the Bluetooth patchram for btbcm.
